=== Probe 3: sigma/seat Fisher partition (replication self-check + content-only) ===
  [A REPLICATION  hollow IN,  known out  (must match 58/62|36/32 p=0.6490)] n=188: sigma 58/62  seat 36/32  consistent 90/188=47.9%  Fisher p=0.6490
  [B CONTENT-ONLY hollow OUT, known out] n=126: sigma 26/58  seat 18/24  consistent 50/126=39.7%  Fisher p=0.2348
  [C CONTENT-ONLY hollow OUT, known in ] n=138: sigma 31/59  seat 24/24  consistent 55/138=39.9%  Fisher p=0.1002
  -> B inverts vs A (47.9%->39.7%): the sigma side decontaminates toward the unstable cast multisets. sigma/seat is not the stability partition.

